{"npc_id": "florenca", "game_id": "58d69ffe-e3c0-47cf-84aa-1f3ff8db3bfa", "same_scenario_followup": true, "question": "E o que você acha disso, pessoalmente? Por onde eu começo?", "status": "completed", "reply": "Pessoalmente, acho que o ciúme é como a maré: chega sem permissão e deixa areia em lugares onde não devia. Comece onde os rumores são mais grossos – as esquinas do Largo de São Francisco ou a padaria do Sr. José, onde os boatos ficam quentes como pão no forno. E evite Escobar; os homens assim guardam segredos que nem eles mesmos entendem.", "usage": {"game_id": "58d69ffe-e3c0-47cf-84aa-1f3ff8db3bfa", "coverage": "recorded_calls_only", "first_recorded_at": "2026-11-02T23:23:54.478809Z", "last_recorded_at": "2026-11-02T23:23:56.772577Z", "totals": {"calls": 2, "completed_calls": 2, "failed_calls": 0, "cancelled_calls": 0, "known_input_tokens": 4572, "known_output_tokens": 265, "calls_with_missing_tokens": 0, "unpriced_calls": 0, "known_estimated_cost_usd": "0.0008448", "cost_complete": true, "duration_ms": 3930}, "by_purpose": [{"calls": 1, "completed_calls": 1, "failed_calls": 0, "cancelled_calls": 0, "known_input_tokens": 4238, "known_output_tokens": 104, "calls_with_missing_tokens": 0, "unpriced_calls": 0, "known_estimated_cost_usd": "0.0006981", "cost_complete": true, "duration_ms": 2293, "key": "player_dialogue"}, {"calls": 1, "completed_calls": 1, "failed_calls": 0, "cancelled_calls": 0, "known_input_tokens": 334, "known_output_tokens": 161, "calls_with_missing_tokens": 0, "unpriced_calls": 0, "known_estimated_cost_usd": "0.0001467", "cost_complete": true, "duration_ms": 1637, "key": "session_master"}], "by_model": [{"calls": 2, "completed_calls": 2, "failed_calls": 0, "cancelled_calls": 0, "known_input_tokens": 4572, "known_output_tokens": 265, "calls_with_missing_tokens": 0, "unpriced_calls": 0, "known_estimated_cost_usd": "0.0008448", "cost_complete": true, "duration_ms": 3930, "key": "qwen.qwen3-32b"}], "pricing_snapshots": [{"model": "qwen.qwen3-32